3.2 The Language Shift
Every word matters when selling to PE. Here are the translations:
• Never say 'chatbot.' Say 'AI-powered customer engagement that reduces response time
and increases conversion.'
• Never say 'automation.' Say 'operational efficiency initiative with projected X% cost
reduction.'
• Never say 'monthly subscription.' Say 'implementation engagement with ongoing
optimization.'
• Never say 'we build AI tools.' Say 'we deploy AI solutions that directly impact EBITDA
metrics your LPs are tracking.'
• Never say 'ROI.' Say 'value creation multiple' or 'margin expansion impact.'
• Never lead with technology. Lead with the business outcome, then explain how the
technology delivers it.
