4. Go-to-Market Plan
4.1 Phase 1: Foundation (Weeks 1-4)
1. Build the PE-specific pitch deck: Completely separate from the current PDS deck.
Focus on EBITDA impact, case studies framed in PE language, and portfolio-wide
deployment capability. Include logos of any recognizable clients or industries.
2. Create a PE-focused landing page: Either a section on the PDS site or a separate
microsite. Speak directly to operating partners and value creation teams. Include a
downloadable whitepaper like 'AI Value Creation Playbook for PE Portfolio Companies.'
3. Build the target list: Use the PEI 300 as the starting framework. Focus on firms ranked
50-300. Use LinkedIn Sales Navigator and Apollo.io to identify operating partners, tech
operating partners, and value creation team leads at each firm. Goal: 500 named
contacts at 150 firms.
4. Publish thought leadership content: Write 2-3 LinkedIn articles specifically about AI
implementation challenges in PE portfolio companies. Reference the Bain, HBR, and
ECA Partners research. Position yourself as someone who has read the literature and
can execute against it.
